    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abisirayeli batsinda Abamidiyani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwiteka abwira Mose ati ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Uhōrere Abisirayeli Abamidiyani, maze nyuma uzapfa usange ubwoko bwawe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose abwira abantu ati “Mutoranye abantu bo gutabara, mubahe intwaro batere Abamidiyani, kugira ngo Uwiteka ababahoreshe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukure ingabo igihumbi mu muryango umwe no mu yindi y'Abisirayeli yose, bityo bityo mubohereze batabare.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko batoranya mu bihumbi by'Abisirayeli ingabo igihumbi igihumbi mu miryango yose, ziba ingabo inzovu n'ibihumbi bibiri zifite intwaro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose yohereza izo ngabo ari igihumbi igihumbi mu miryango yose, ngo batabare, aboherezanya na Finehasi mwene Eleyazari umutambyi, ajyanye ibintu by'ahera n'amakondera yo kuvuzwa ijwi rirandaze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barwanya Abamidiyani uko Uwiteka yategetse Mose, bica abagabo bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bica n'abami b'Abamidiyani ari bo: Evi na Rekemu na Suri, na Huri na Reba, abami b'Abamidiyani uko ari batanu, kandi na Balāmu mwene Bewori bamwicisha inkota.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abisirayeli bajyana ho abanyagano Abamidiyanikazi n'abana babo bato, banyaga inka zabo zose n'imikumbi yabo yose, basahura n'ibintu byabo byose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batwika imidugudu babagamo yose n'ingo zabo zose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batabarukana isahu yose n'iminyago yose y'abantu n'amatungo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imbohe n'iminyago n'isahu babizanira Mose na Eleyazari umutambyi n'iteraniro ry'Abisirayeli, aho baganditse mu kibaya cy'i Mowabu kinini, kuri Yorodani ahateganye n'i Yeriko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ibyategekewe Abamidiyanikazi, no ku minyago n'isahu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose na Eleyazari umutambyi n'abatware b'iteraniro bose, babasanganirira inyuma y'aho baganditse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose arakarira abatware b'ingabo, abatware b'ibihumbi n'ab'amagana batabarutse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arababaza ati “Ko mwakijije abagore bose ntibapfe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.25.1+NUM.25.2+NUM.25.3+NUM.25.4+NUM.25.5+NUM.25.6+NUM.25.7+NUM.25.8+NUM.25.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 25.1-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Dore abo ni bo bacumuje Abisirayeli ku Uwiteka mu by'i Pewori babitewe n'inama za Balāmu, bituma mugiga itera iteraniro ry'Uwiteka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko none mwice umuhungu wese wo mu bana bato, n'umugore wese wigeze kuryamana n'umugabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko abakobwa bato bose batigeze kuryamana n'abagabo, mubīkirize ubwanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi mubambe amahema yanyu inyuma y'aho tuganditse, mumareyo iminsi irindwi: uwishe wese n'uwakoze ku ntumbi wese, mwihumanure ku munsi wa gatatu no ku wa karindwi mwe n'iminyago yanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muhumanure n'imyambaro yose n'ibyaremwe mu ruhu byose, n'ibyaboheshejwe ubwoya bw'ihene byose, n'ibyabajwe byose kugira ngo mubyihumanureho.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eleyazari umutambyi abwira abatabarutse ati “Iri ni itegeko Uwiteka yategetse Mose: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izahabu n'ifeza n'umuringa, n'icyuma n'ibati n'icyuma cy'isasu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ibintu byose bidatwikwa n'umuriro, mubicīshe mu muriro bibone guhumanuka. Ariko kandi mubihumanuze na ya mazi ahumanura, kandi ibyatwikwa n'umuriro byose mubyogeshe ayo mazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku wa karindwi muzamese imyenda yanyu, muhumanuke mubone kugaruka mu ngando.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwiteka abwira Mose ati ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bara umubare w'iminyago yanyazwe y'abantu n'amatungo, ufatanye na Eleyazari umutambyi n'abatware b'amazu ya ba sekuruza y'iteraniro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ugabanye iminyago mu migabane ibiri ingana: umwe uhabwe abazi kurasana batabarutse, undi uhabwe iteraniro ryose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi utorere Uwiteka intore, uzitore abarasanyi batabarutse, kimwe muri magana atanu cy'abantu n'inka n'indogobe n'imikumbi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ubitore mu mugabane wabo ubihe Eleyazari umutambyi, bibe ituro ryererejwe Uwiteka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi mu mugabane w'Abisirayeli utore umwe muri mirongo itanu w'abantu, na kimwe muri mirongo itanu cy'inka n'indogobe n'imikumbi, n'andi matungo yose, ubihe Abalewi barinda ubuturo bw'Uwiteka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose na Eleyazari umutambyi babigenza uko Uwiteka yategetse Mose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
